A8pUfcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=39377&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hLNr3knlQVLRUPoBRAfnm-PUlUZLR9GYMlCinlUPLzliLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7n1yinkhVLz67M4nkL7-bLN-8LR6VnmnkLmGZMlnfnNQFUmUYozUaU4VFL8UYnz9Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7Dg4LbL4vsgtA8pUfcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=39377&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1DF5DE17D74B0B92B407EF4B2085DAFF/B42940C1/3D2E8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 244px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hLNr3knlQVLRUPoBRAfnm-PUlUZLR9GYMlCinlUPLzliLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7n1yinkhVLz67M4nkL7-bLN-8LR6VnmnkLmGZMlnfnNQFUmUYozUaU4VFL8UYnz9Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7Dg4LbL4vsgtA8pUfcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=39377&e=.png\"></p><p>本次宣讲活动成效显著，有效拉近了学校与广大考生、家长的距离，全方位、多角度展示了我校优良的办学底蕴与各学科的强劲实力。全体宣讲老师不辞辛劳、奔走各地，以认真严谨的工作态度、耐心细致的服务态度完成宣讲工作。</p><p>同时由衷感谢所有宣讲教师的辛苦付出，学院也将持续推进招生宣传工作，搭建好中学与高校的沟通纽带，吸引更多优秀学子走进中北、选择中北。</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hUl-3an778oR6RMB7-sL8CZMmf2oRrG2oRvYnRN4ozTkL4l0gihFp2hmCIa0okyaMYh2USyiUl7aUz9inzrknll8UmL8L8UsU87PLzLZU8rFLlCPnz-iMNVFL4lin77Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7Dg4LbL4vsgtA8pUfcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1816&nid=39377&e=.png"}